      </li>
      <li style="margin-bottom:0.75rem;padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative;">
        <span style="color:#e00;position:absolute;left:0;">✓</span>
        Quality inspection: 2-3 days
      </li>
      <li style="padding-left:1.5rem;position:relative;">
        <span style="color:#e00;position:absolute;left:0;">✓</span>
        Packing and shipping: 3-5 days
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p style="color:#FFFFFF;max-width:800px;line-height:1.8;font-size:0.95rem;margin-top:2rem;">
      Total timeline: 50-75 days from order to delivery. Custom pattern development and fit testing add 5-10 days. Rush production available at 20-30% premium.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FAQ Section -->
<section style="padding:5rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header" style="margin-bottom:3rem;">
      <span class="section-label">Common Questions</span>
      <div class="accent-line"></div>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.4rem);font-weight:300;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1rem;">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
    </div>
    
    <div style="max-width:800px;">
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What is the minimum order for petite clothing?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">300 pieces per style minimum. This applies per design, colorway, and size range. Lower quantities possible at higher per-piece cost for sampling or prototype runs.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What height range do you consider petite?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">We consider petite as 5'4\" and under. Our specialized patterns and proportional adjustments are designed specifically for this height range to ensure proper fit without alterations.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Do you offer proportional adjustments for petite sizing?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Yes. We offer proportional adjustments including shortened sleeves, adjusted torso length, scaled proportions, and proper inseam lengths. All adjustments maintain the design integrity while fitting petite frames.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">What petite products do you manufacture?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">We manufacture petite dresses, tops, bottoms, outerwear, workwear, and casual wear. All categories are available with petite-specific patterns and proportional adjustments.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="border-bottom:1px solid #e00;padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How do you ensure proper fit for petite frames?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">We use specialized petite patterns, conduct fit testing with petite fit models, and adjust proportions based on real-world feedback. Our grading ensures consistent fit across the petite size range.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="padding:1.5rem 0;">
        <h3 style="font-size:1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">How long does petite clothing production take?</h3>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.8;">Standard production timeline: 30-40 days from fabric receipt for basic petite clothing. 35-50 days for custom pattern development or specialized fit requirements. 7-14 days for sampling before bulk.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CTA Section -->
